WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Sunday dinner, seen from above.

2
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:06.460
Four people, and a phone recording
in the middle of the table.

3
00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:09.660
Forty minutes later, the
bubbles have piled up:

4
00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:14.130
jokes, questions, arguments,
people talking over each other.

5
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.220
That recording could answer
hundreds of questions.

6
00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:19.900
So which one is actually worth asking?

7
00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:24.920
In this mission, you'll ask what makes one
research question worth more than another.

8
00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:28.420
You'll ask whether your family talks
the same way when they know the phone is

9
00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:29.300
listening.

10
00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:34.040
And you'll ask what you owe the people
at the table before you press record.

11
00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:38.200
Your mission: decide what question
your recording could answer.
